格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"跨工作区独立人格、自适应风格与陪伴预设：为项目和对话分别维护人格与确认后的通用偏好，支持任意 DSH 已注册模型的子代理路由（含通过其他插件接入的 Codex、Claude Code）。","id":"gh:1342829444","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-evo-subagent","slug":"ZekaiShi/dsh-evo-subagent","topics":["agent-plugin","ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm-agent","model-routing","plugin","subagent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"跨工作区独立人格、自适应风格与陪伴预设：为项目和对话分别维护人格与确认后的通用偏好，支持任意 DSH 已注册模型的子代理路由（含通过其他插件接入的 Codex、Claude Code）。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-evo-subagent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Different workspaces, different personalities. A familiar assistant that adapts to you.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Independent workspace personas · Adaptive styles · Preferences you control**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Give development projects an efficient partner, discussions an independent perspective, and everyday"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" conversations a warmer companion. Share one persona or keep each workspace separate, with an option"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"al independent persona for an individual conversation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Feature | What you get |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Workspace personas | Set a name, preset and style guidance for each project. |\n| Conversation pers"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"onas | Follow the workspace or give this conversation its own persona. |\n| Adaptive styles | Refine "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"tone, detail and interaction through your explicit feedback. |\n| Companion presets | Choose warm, ca"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"lm, playful, direct or patient styles. |\n| Approved preferences | Keep general communication habits "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"in one editable summary. |\n| Role-based collaboration | Route subagents to any registered model and "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"retain useful project experience. |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Independent profiles learn within their own scope without updating the shared persona. New long-term"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" preferences require your approval."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Requires DeepSeek Harness `^0.2.1-rc.2` and Node.js `>=24.2.0`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Previously installed as `evo-subagent`? Remove the old package, then install the new name:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Existing local personas, preferences, role bindings and project experience are reused."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Open DSH's **plugin settings** and select **dsh-evo-subagent**."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Companion persona:** check **Separate persona for each workspace** to list your workspaces. Expa"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"nd a project to enable its persona and choose a name, preset and style guidance. Uncheck it to use o"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ne shared persona; saved workspace profiles remain available.\n- **Inside a conversation:** open **Pe"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"rsona** beside the input. Choose **Follow workspace settings** or **This conversation only**. New in"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"dependent conversation profiles start with background learning paused.\n- **Adaptive style:** choose "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"**Autonomous exploration** and enable **Get to know me**. Give explicit direction, such as “Be conci"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"se when coding, and listen before offering advice when I talk about worries.”\n- **User habits:** mai"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"ntain one short summary of general preferences. New suggestions appear in a matching collapsible pan"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"el for you to edit and approve.\n- **Subagent management:** choose a workspace, add built-in roles or"},{"id":"p19s10","text":" your own agent files, and select registered models. Supports models registered by provider plugins,"},{"id":"p19s11","text":" including Codex and Claude Code."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Persona changes apply to subsequent replies. General habits have their own sharing controls, so you "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"can share communication preferences while keeping project personas separate."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Your data and control"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Profiles stay in the local DSH user directory. Background persona learning sends small conversation "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"excerpts to the selected model and incurs additional usage. You can pause learning, forget preferenc"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"es or restore a previous style."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## What's new in 1.2"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- Renamed the package and repository from **evo-subagent** to **dsh-evo-subagent**.\n- Simplified wor"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"kspace independence to one checkbox with collapsible workspace settings.\n- Simplified conversation c"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"hoices and aligned preference-update panels with the rest of the interface."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Full changelog · Release notes"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Walkthrough"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Watch the subagent-management video. This recording covers role configuration; persona settings are "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nt-management video. This recording covers role configuration; persona settings are described above."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Download history"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The chart combines cumulative npm downloads for `evo-subagent` and `dsh-evo-subagent`, updated daily"},{"id":"p29s2","text":". Downloads do not represent unique users."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Report an issue · MIT License"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
